  "description": "Safa is a rich and elegant fragrance that blends warm spices, smooth woods, and creamy amber sweetness into a luxurious unisex scent. The fragrance feels refined, comforting, and slightly oriental with a balanced modern warmth. The opening introduces spicy accords with subtle citrus freshness, creating a warm and inviting first impression with a touch of brightness. The heart develops into woody notes and soft florals, adding depth and smooth sophistication to the composition. The base settles into amber, vanilla, musk, and oud, leaving a warm, creamy, and long-lasting trail that feels sensual, smooth, and luxurious. Safa is perfect for those who enjoy warm woody amber fragrances with soft sweetness and an elegant Middle Eastern character.",
